# Office-Network-Hardening

Short: Simulated office network design, hardening scripts and monitoring configuration.

## Contents
- network-diagram.png
- configs/        # router/switch configs or Packet Tracer files
- hardening.sh    # server hardening script
- fail2ban/       # sample fail2ban config
- network_report.pdf

## Quick run
1. Load Packet Tracer/GNS3 file in `configs/` or follow steps in `network_report.pdf`.
2. On Ubuntu server: `sudo bash hardening.sh` (review script before running).

## Notes
- All configurations are for lab/testing use only.

